OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment set to nationalise
OL,4,Atroubled steel firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FReynolds said a bidder had come forward
OL,7,Fearlier this year, but the government
OL,8,Fhad decided against supporting it,
OL,9,Fciting "serious concerns" over the
OL,10,Fproposed financing of the deal and
OL,11,F"protections for UK taxpayers".
